WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.049
Mandy and Twi joined some women, who greeted Mandy with smiles.

2
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:10.942
Twi gave Mandy a cloth bag to hang over her shoulder.

3
00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:15.084
"You put the nuts in here," said Twi.

4
00:00:15.085 --> 00:00:18.492
The women headed off into the bushes.

5
00:00:18.493 --> 00:00:23.487
Mandy looked for Vinnie, but he had already left.

6
00:00:23.488 --> 00:00:28.803
The women and girls reached some tall trees and then split up.

7
00:00:28.804 --> 00:00:34.956
Each woman worked under a tree, collecting the nuts on the ground.

8
00:00:34.957 --> 00:00:37.553
"I’ll be over there,"

9
00:00:37.554 --> 00:00:41.946
grinned Twi, pointing to a nearby tree.

10
00:00:41.947 --> 00:00:47.416
"Wait! What do the nuts look like?" cried Mandy.

11
00:00:47.417 --> 00:00:53.470
"Look," smiled Twi, as she picked up an egg-shaped nut.

12
00:00:53.471 --> 00:00:56.073
"This is the mongongo."

13
00:00:56.074 --> 00:01:01.087
Then Twi left Mandy to gather the strange nuts.

14
00:01:01.088 --> 00:01:08.860
"Well," thought Mandy, "at least I’m not doing anything horrible like hunting."

15
00:01:08.861 --> 00:01:15.613
Meanwhile, Vinnie was watching Kashe as he reached into a small cloth bag.

16
00:01:15.614 --> 00:01:20.428
"Pay attention," said Kashe, holding up an arrow.

17
00:01:20.429 --> 00:01:23.279
"We will add the poison now."

18
00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:27.222
"Poison?" asked Vinnie, nervously.

19
00:01:27.223 --> 00:01:31.474
"Hold this arrow, Vinnie," said Kashe.

20
00:01:31.475 --> 00:01:34.680
Vinnie held the arrow carefully.

21
00:01:34.681 --> 00:01:36.938
"These are beetle larvae,"

22
00:01:36.939 --> 00:01:41.669
explained Kashe, holding up some small yellow things.

23
00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:44.415
"They contain poison."

24
00:01:44.416 --> 00:01:48.084
He squeezed some liquid from one larva.

25
00:01:48.085 --> 00:01:51.343
Then he put it on the arrow.

26
00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:56.951
"We shoot the animal and the poison goes into the blood," said Kashe.

27
00:01:56.952 --> 00:02:00.086
"Soon, the animal dies."

28
00:02:00.087 --> 00:02:04.410
Another man named Gau came running up.

29
00:02:04.411 --> 00:02:08.214
"We have spotted the birds," he said.

30
00:02:08.215 --> 00:02:11.964
"Do you shoot birds?" asked Vinnie.

31
00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:14.488
Kashe shook his head.

32
00:02:14.489 --> 00:02:18.811
"Birds circle in the sky above a dying animal.

33
00:02:18.812 --> 00:02:22.106
We are close to an animal we shot yesterday.

34
00:02:22.107 --> 00:02:25.806
We must go and carry it back to the village."

35
00:02:25.807 --> 00:02:31.800
Meanwhile, Mandy was thinking that picking nuts wasn’t much fun.

36
00:02:31.801 --> 00:02:34.819
"Mandy, how many have you got?"

37
00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:37.414
Twi walked over to her.

38
00:02:37.415 --> 00:02:40.886
Twi’s bag was overflowing with nuts.

39
00:02:40.887 --> 00:02:44.166
Mandy only had a few.

40
00:02:44.167 --> 00:02:49.827
"How did you get so many so fast?" asked Mandy.

41
00:02:49.828 --> 00:02:57.605
"We learn how to pick mongongo nuts when we are very young," said Twi, grinning. "Watch!"

42
00:02:57.606 --> 00:02:59.396
She bent down.

43
00:02:59.397 --> 00:03:03.144
Her hands moved quickly back and forth on the ground.

44
00:03:03.145 --> 00:03:09.223
Then she stood up, smiled, and used only her toes to pick up a nut.

45
00:03:09.224 --> 00:03:13.452
Mandy laughed and clapped her hands.

46
00:03:13.453 --> 00:03:16.081
"That’s amazing!"

47
00:03:16.082 --> 00:03:21.833
The other women gathered together and emptied their bags on the ground.

48
00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:23.522
"The nuts are heavy.

49
00:03:23.523 --> 00:03:27.675
So we crack the shells off here," explained Twi.

50
00:03:27.676 --> 00:03:31.939
"Then our bags are much lighter for the journey home."

51
00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:35.672
"Good idea!" said Mandy.

52
00:03:35.673 --> 00:03:41.876
"Oh, while we’re here," Twi said, "I want to show you something."

53
00:03:41.877 --> 00:03:45.943
Mandy followed Twi to a small cave.

54
00:03:45.944 --> 00:03:50.934
At the opening, they found a rock with some paintings on it.

55
00:03:50.935 --> 00:03:55.825
"These are drawings my ancestors made," said Twi.

56
00:03:55.826 --> 00:03:59.277
"They tell a story about our people."

57
00:03:59.278 --> 00:04:03.804
Mandy could see animals and dancing men on the rock.

58
00:04:03.805 --> 00:04:07.431
The men had animal features too.

59
00:04:07.432 --> 00:04:09.041
Some had horns.

60
00:04:09.042 --> 00:04:12.010
Others had lion’s legs.

61
00:04:12.011 --> 00:04:17.133
"This is the object in the photo!" shouted Mandy.

62
00:04:17.134 --> 00:04:20.819
"What do you mean?" cried Twi.

63
00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:33.323
"So why am I still here?" thought Mandy.

